{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30255","headline":"题春台观 · 薛逢","name":"题春台观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"殿前松柏晦苍苍，杏遶仙坛水遶廊。\n垂露额题精思院，博山炉褭降真香。\n苔侵古碣迷陈事，云到中峯失上方。\n便拟寻溪弄花去，洞天谁更待刘郎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛逢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30255.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30255","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}